# Everything here is read by a Linux toolchain inside a container, from a tree
# that may have been checked out on Windows. A CRLF in build.sh is a script
# that fails with `$'\r': command not found`; a CRLF in embed.ipxe is a script
# iPXE runs with a carriage return on the end of every URL.
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.ipxe        text eol=lf
*.h           text eol=lf
*.patch       text eol=lf
Containerfile text eol=lf
UPSTREAM      text eol=lf
